$1,299 · 1.2 kg · 18 h</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Pros</span>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\">\n          <li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li>\n          <li>Great battery</li>\n          <li>Quiet under load</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Cons</span>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\">\n          <li>Soldered RAM</li>\n          <li>Glossy screen</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\">Choose Aero 14</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Compare specs</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-model=\"Forge 16\" data-tags=\"power\">\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Forge 16</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge\">4.4 ★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">960 reviews · $1,899 · 2.1 kg · 9 h</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Pros</span>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\">\n          <li>Fastest of the three</li>\n          <li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li>\n          <li>Full port selection</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Cons</span>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\">\n          <li>Heavy</li>\n          <li>Fans are audible</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\">Choose Forge 16</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Compare specs</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-model=\"Nimbus 13\" data-tags=\"budget\">\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge\">4.2 ★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">2,310 reviews · $999 · 1.0 kg · 22 h</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Pros</span>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\">\n          <li>Lightest</li>\n          <li>Best battery life</li>\n          <li>Lowest price</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Cons</span>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\">\n          <li>Dimmer screen</li>\n          <li>Small SSD</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\">Choose Nimbus 13</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Compare specs</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2\">\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Price vs performance</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Processor cores at each price point — the Forge costs46% more than the Aero for roughly twice the core count.</p>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Processor cores\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":6},{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":8},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":16}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Everyday carry weight</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Lower is lighter. The Forge carries1.1 kg more than the Nimbus — close to the weight of a full water bottle.</p>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight in kg\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1.0},{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2\">\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Battery life</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Rated hours of mixed use, from a full charge.</p>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Hours of battery life\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22},{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Share of the price range</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Total spend across the three is $4,197. The Nimbus takes 23.8% of it, the Aero 30.9% and the Forge 45.2%.</p>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"pie\",\"title\":\"Price share\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999},{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <h2 class=\"card-title\">Customer ratings</h2>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Average score out of 5, with review counts in brackets. The Aero leads on score; the Nimbus leads on volume, with the most reviews of any model.</p>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Model</th>\n          <th>Score</th>\n          <th>Reviews</th>\n          <th>Share of reviews</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Aero 14</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4.6</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">1,840</td>\n          <td>\n            <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:36%\"></div></div>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">36.0%</span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Forge 16</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4.4</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">960</td>\n          <td>\n            <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:19%\"></div></div>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">18.8%</span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Nimbus 13</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4.2</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">2,310</td>\n          <td>\n            <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:45%\"></div></div>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">45.2%</span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">5,110 reviews in total across the range.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <h2 class=\"card-title\">How to pick one</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">Pick the Aero 14</span>\n        <p class=\"small\">If you want one laptop for flights, meetings and a full day of work without hunting for a socket. Best balance of screen quality, silence and battery — and the highest rating at 4.6.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Trade-off: the RAM is soldered, so 16 GB is what you get for good.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Pick the Forge 16</span>\n        <p class=\"small\">If you render video, build 3D scenes or game on the road. Twice the memory, the largest screen, the full port selection and upgradeable internals.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Trade-off: 2.1 kg, a 9-hour battery and audible fans.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Pick the Nimbus 13</span>\n        <p class=\"small\">If you're writing notes, browsing, coding lightly and keeping the price down. The lightest, the longest battery and the cheapest by $300.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Trade-off: a dimmer 13\" screen and only 256 GB of storage.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Still undecided? Aero 14 if you're split. It sits between the other two on price ($1,299), weight (1.2 kg) and battery (18 h) while matching the Nimbus's memory and beating both on rating.</p>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  [data-model][hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  td[data-best]::after {\n    content: \" ★\";\n    co